See NOTICE.md and the files in LICENSES/ for attribution and license details.

License plate fonts
-------------------

No license plate font files are included in this development package. Graphical license
plates require the user to provide a supported GL-Nummernschild font file or a legacy
EuroPlate.ttf file. Users are responsible for ensuring that their use of those font files
is permitted by the relevant license.
